 "summary": "A PNP bipolar transistor in the three-lead SOT-23 surface-mount package. It withstands -25 V collector to emitter and -40 V collector to base, carries up to -0.5 A of continuous collector current and dissipates 0.3 W at 25 °C ambient. Its DC gain hFE(1) at -50 mA is 120 to 400, sorted into ranks L (120-200), H (200-350) and J (300-400); the 120-200 range is rank L. The NPN counterpart is the S8050.",
